<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Burlington Coat upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Burlington Coat upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said Wednesday it upgraded Burlington Coat Factory Warehouse Corp to neutral from sell and would even encourage aggressive accounts to buy the stock for short-term appreciation.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We think there is little downside from current levels,&quot; Rodman &amp; Renshaw said in a report.</p>
<p>-- It raised its EPS estimate for the June 1997 year by $0.10 to $0.90 due to stronger sales.</p>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw expects the stock to trade as high as $15.</p>
<p>-- Burlington Coat was trading at 10-1/2.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
